Kind: ablation
Issue: #599
Takes out: nothing -- a probe: after tick 3000 one thread_switch on processor 0 returns to user mode at splsched, #599's second hypothesis, and return_to_user's check must say so
Run: i386, UROS_NCPUS > 1 -- scripts/run-qemu.sh --fresh-disk --smp 4 -display none -serial mon:stdio
Expect: spl: returning to user mode at spl

diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/i386/clock_watch.c b/uros/src/mach_kernel/i386/clock_watch.c
